PS+=['【Zac】August 20, 2024\nYou all know that I am traveling around the USA. A few days ago, I happened to see a place with a special name “Hot Coffee” on Google map. I wanted to know more about it, so I went there. To my surprise, it is a very small place, with only a few houses and stores. Before I went there, I googled it and knew that it got the name in 1870 because people could buy hot coffee there. So I went to one store and got myself a cup of coffee. Well, it tasted quite... common! Haha! I also collected some interesting place names in the USA as below. Do you know any interesting one around the world? Share it with me!\nOne Mile (Arizona)｜Two Egg (Florida)｜Three Rivers (Michigan)｜Four Holes (South Carolina)｜Five Points (Kansas)\nSix Lakes (Michigan)｜Seven Devils (North Carolina)｜Eight Corners (Wisconsin)｜Nine Times (South Carolina)｜Ten Sleep (Wyoming)\n\n【Wendy】In my country Taiwan, one of my friends lives in “Dream.” Every time I visit her, I have to take the bus to “Dream.”\n\n(google 搜尋　hole 洞　devil 惡魔)']
