PS+=['In a world of songs so sweet and clear,\nI dance with joy to the sound only — I hold it ever so dear.\nIn the quiet and magic moments, my special song,\nA different sound guiding me comfortably along.\n\nLife breaks out to be pieces of experiences here and there,\nIn my own way, little by little I learn to show how much I care.\nColors break out like bright stars in my mind,\nA beautiful kaleidoscope of ideas, one of a kind.\n\nRed, blue and yellow looking so bright,\nI find hope in the quiet of the night.\nWith each lazy walk, finding my very own way,\nBright stars of hope light up my every day.\n\nThrough the bright colors, I find my way,\nIn the dance of life, how happily I play.\nWith a heart full of hope and a song so clear,\nI’ll keep dancing on in this world — I warmly hold it so dear.\n\n(guide 指引　kaleidoscope 萬花筒　poem 詩　title 標題)']
